  "pen_attachment": "The same original pen remains in its loop on the right board in all art, including the written views. No hand-held writing pen is depicted.",
  "method": "Endpoint states retain source PNG samples by integer translation. In-between poses are derived geometric composites, not original action drawings. A masked leather cover and inside left page block rotate about their shared spine. The right page block and its single original pen follow the stable rear board. No two complete notebooks are blended. Intermediate angles are art-direction angles, not measured 3D orientations. The default loop uses blank leaves. State-specific lists keep the selected handwriting on the paper until the closing cover hides it. Use closing_frames_by_state.open_filled after writing.",
